      "MADELYN: Yeah.\nVIVIAN: Did you know little Rusty had to sign a loyalty pledge?",
      "VIVIAN: I'm done.\nMADELYN: That? Right there? Was funnier than anything you've written so far this year.",
      "VIVIAN: Jesus Christ.\nLUCY: You don't have to fuck off, but you do have to know that Danny does jokes and few people do it better. I do physical comedy.",
      "LUCY: It's not a punch, I'm having a baby.\nMADELYN: What do we do now?\nLUCY: I know it seems like no one said congratulations, but that can not be, as these are three of our closest friends and colleagues.",
